WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:04.830
into the greatest nation in the world in the&nbsp;
shortest possible span of time to 158 million&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:09.030
Americans it has meant higher wages shorter&nbsp;
working hours more and better products and&nbsp;&nbsp;

